Solution Architecture

The preferred solution is:

Working Salary Review workbook modified

→ SharePoint Power Automate trigger

→ confirm the modified file is the Working workbook

→ retrieve file modification metadata

→ run Office Script against Baseline workbook

→ return Baseline data as structured JSON

→ run Office Script against Working workbook

→ compare Working against Baseline

→ return detected changes as structured JSON

→ Parse JSON in Power Automate

→ verify changes exist

→ group changes by Employee ID where appropriate

→ create audit log record

→ create Teams notification

→ verify notification succeeded

→ update Baseline

This is the default architecture unless there is a strong technical reason to use another design.

