Baseline Update Safety

The Baseline must only be updated after the relevant notification process succeeds.

Never update the Baseline before the change has been successfully processed.

This prevents a failed notification from causing the comparison history to be lost.

The desired lifecycle is:

Baseline = £3,000

Working changed to £4,000

Notification:
£3,000 → £4,000

Baseline becomes £4,000.

Later Working changes to £4,500.

Notification:
£4,000 → £4,500

Never send:
£3,000 → £4,500

unless the previous baseline update genuinely failed.

