Duplicate Prevention

Design the flow to avoid duplicate Teams notifications.

Consider:

* repeated SharePoint modification triggers;
* Excel autosave;
* several edits occurring close together;
* flow concurrency;
* the Baseline being updated by the automation itself.

Where appropriate recommend:

* Trigger Conditions
* concurrency control
* a brief delay/debounce strategy
* audit IDs
* comparison-before-notification logic

Explain why any recommended setting is needed.

